<title>SOUTH KOREA: South Korean TV denies N.Korean death report.</title>
<headline>South Korean TV denies N.Korean death report.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's state broadcaster withdrew a report that bodies of four North Korean infiltrators had been found on Friday.</p>
<p>The Korea Broadcasting System said it had checked the report and found it was not true. There was no further explanation.</p>
